From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 18:14:59 -0700
Subject: [Media] Disable kDisallowMixedOpaqueMediaResponses by default

Disable the kDisallowMixedOpaqueMediaResponses kill switch introduced in
crrev.com/c/8564157 by default. Suppress failing web tests in
TestExpectations and disable the corresponding MultiBufferDataSourceTest
unit tests while the feature is disabled.

Bug: 572307225
Change-Id: Iaba10e5e6a28d14b7cff8e48142f77ee49d4e052
Fixed: 573441094
Reviewed-on: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/8677461
Reviewed-by: Ted (Chromium) Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Commit-Queue: Ted (Chromium) Meyer <tmathmeyer@chromium.org>
Auto-Submit: Dale Curtis <dalecurtis@chromium.org>
Cr-Commit-Position: refs/heads/main@{#1729808}

